{"id": 8324659642566, "title": "Momcozy Breast Milk Storage Container", "body_html": "<article class=\"4ever-article\"><span><span><strong>DURABLE AND TEMPERATURE-RESILIENT:</strong> Crafted from high-grade borosilicate glass, the Momcozy breast milk pitcher is engineered for everyday safety and durability. It can be stored in the refrigerator or sterilized at high temperatures, holding up to the temperature shifts of regular use.</span></span></article>\n<article class=\"4ever-article\"><span><span></span></span></article>\n<article class=\"4ever-article\"><span><span></span></span></article>\n<article class=\"4ever-article\"><span><span></span></span></article>\n<article class=\"4ever-article\"><span><span></span></span></article>\n<article class=\"4ever-article\"><span></span></article>\n<p><strong>LEAK-PROOF AND GOOD SEALING</strong>: With its thickened sealing strip design, Momcozy breast milk pitcher offers reliable leak-proof performance, keeping them fresh, cherish every drop of hard-earned breast milk.</p>\n<p><strong>NEW MOMS BREASTFEEDING ESSENTIALS</strong>: Food-grade and BPA-free to make pump milk storage and breastfeeding hassle-free for moms. Engineered with ergonomic precision, the handle offers optimal comfort.</p>\n<p><strong>EASY TO USE AND CLEAN</strong>: Momcozy breast milk pitcher adopts a wide-mouth design making it easy for busy nursing moms to pour milk and clean storage bottles quickly.</p>\n<p><strong>MULTIFUNCTIONAL USE</strong>: Momcozy breastmilk pitcher is available for breast milk/juice/coffee/tea/other liquids. Furthermore, Its adaptable design extends its utility as a convenient baby formula maker pitcher.</p>\n<p><span><span><strong><span>⚠️</span>USE SAFELY ACROSS TEMPERATURES:</strong> To avoid unexpected damage, allow the pitcher to return to room temperature before sterilizing or adding hot water. Avoid moving it directly between boiling and freezing temperatures. We recommend discontinuing use if any small cracks appear for safety.</span></span></p>", "vendor": "momcozy", "product_type": "Storage Bags", "created_at": "2024-09-13T03:02:57-04:00", "handle": "momcozy-breast-milk-pitcher", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:09-04:00", "published_at": "2024-09-13T03:02:57-04:00", "template_suffix": "bp-milk-storage-container", "published_scope": "global", "tags": "Breastfeeding supplies, Top100_Sales, 储奶收集, 吸奶器, 吸奶器小品, 小品主链", "variants": [{"id": 44095934464198, "product_id": 8324659642566, "title": "Gray", "price": "34.99", "sku": "GP001-GR00NB-A", "position": 1, "compare_at_price": "34.99", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_management": null, "option1": "Gray", "option2": null, "option3": null, "created_at": "2024-09-13T03:02:57-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:09-04:00", "taxable": true, "barcode": "892713239232", "grams": 649, "image_id": 42792030994630, "weight": 0.6486, "weight_unit": "kg", "tax_code": "", "requires_shipping": true, "quantity_rule": {"min": 1, "max": null, "increment": 1}, "price_currency": "USD", "compare_at_price_currency": "USD", "quantity_price_breaks": []}, {"id": 44095934496966, "product_id": 8324659642566, "title": "Green", "price": "34.99", "sku": "GP001-GE00NB-A", "position": 2, "compare_at_price": "34.99", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_management": null, "option1": "Green", "option2": null, "option3": null, "created_at": "2024-09-13T03:02:57-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:09-04:00", "taxable": true, "barcode": "89271323916", "grams": 649, "image_id": 42792031191238, "weight": 0.6486, "weight_unit": "kg", "tax_code": "", "requires_shipping": true, "quantity_rule": {"min": 1, "max": null, "increment": 1}, "price_currency": "USD", "compare_at_price_currency": "USD", "quantity_price_breaks": []}], "options": [{"id": 10418026119366, "product_id": 8324659642566, "name": "Color", "position": 1, "values": ["Gray", "Green"]}], "images": [{"id": 42792030994630, "product_id": 8324659642566, "position": 1, "created_at": "2026-05-21T05: